ch row, each column or each diagonal all add up to the same total. This is the line total."},{"type":"text","tex":"Example"},{"type":"text","tex":"This is a 3 by 3 magic square using the integers 1 to 9. The line total is 15."},{"type":"figure","id":"0607_2024FM_52_t1_diagram1"},{"type":"text","tex":"Line totals"},{"type":"text","tex":"Row \\(1 8+1+6 = 15\\) Column \\(1 8+3+4 = 15\\) Left diagonal \\(4+5+6 = 15\\) Row \\(2 3+5+7 = 15\\) Column \\(2 1+5+9 = 15\\) Right diagonal \\(8+5+2 = 15\\) Row \\(3 4+9+2 = 15\\) Column \\(3 6+7+2 = 15\\)"}],"tex_check":"ok"}]}